{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["The reason for mentioning <b>do not profane your daughter</b>: because of laceration for the soul, that it not be exposed before the eyes of all, for a woman's voice is ervah (nakedness), how much more so laceration." "<b>And the land shall not be prostituted.</b> The meaning: the prostitution of the people of the land, like [the construct chain] ארץ כי תחטא לי (when a land sins against me)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {0 "The term שרט/שרט is unclear; rendered literally. The phrase קול שבאשה ערוה alludes to Mishnah Berakhot 3:5; the word לנפש may be a copyist variant for לבתך, but translated as found."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:08.581624910Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}